# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .gitignore — Hooker Descendants repo
#
# KEY PRINCIPLE: version the SOURCE, ignore the BUILD OUTPUT.
# canonical.json is the source of truth and IS committed. Everything under
# static/data/ is REGENERATED from canonical.json by regenerate-data.js in
# seconds — versioning 14,792 generated payload files would bloat the repo and
# make every push slow for zero benefit. So we ignore the generated artifacts
# and keep the repo small and fast to push.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- generated data artifacts (rebuilt by `node regenerate-data.js canonical.json`) ---
static/data/people.json
static/data/table-index.json
static/data/search-index.json
static/data/stats.json
static/data/redirects.json
static/data/cemeteries.json
static/data/institutions.json
# the 14,792 per-person page payloads — pure build output
static/data/person/

# Keep canonical.json itself TRACKED (it's the source). Do NOT ignore it.
# Keep src/, scripts, docs, package.json TRACKED.

# --- node / build ---
node_modules/
.svelte-kit/
build/
dist/
.vercel/
.netlify/

# --- working / scratch (data batches) ---
# only if you ever use a preview draft; not the source
canonical_draft.json
# minified/pruned export of canonical.json — a read-only standalone copy for
# uploads/sharing, never re-imported into the pipeline. NEVER commit it.
canonical.min.json
*.bak
*_backup.json
# validate.py's git-HEAD baseline scratch file
/tmp/baseline.json
tasks.tsv
tasks.csv
tasks-complete.csv
update-steps.txt
blurb_worklist.tsv
nb_worklist.tsv
gender_worklist.tsv

# --- python bytecode (process_tasks.py / validate.py compile cache) ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- editor / OS ---
.DS_Store
.vscode/
*.log
.env
.env.*

# entity image-gap worklist (regenerable side-output, not source)
static/data/image-gaps.tsv
# Playwright
test-results

# card-probe harness screenshots (regenerable) -- 21MB of debug PNGs, never versioned.
# But the BASELINE JSONs in here are not output, they are FIXTURES: probe-demote-settle and
# probe-carousel-regression assert against them, and without them those probes silently skip their
# assertions on a fresh clone. Worse, a baseline that only ever exists on one machine cannot be seen
# to be STALE -- the demote baseline sat three weeks out of date, across two full rebuilds of the
# transition it measured, and read as a live regression every time it ran (roadmap 30).
# Tracked, a re-record shows up as a reviewable diff instead of a silent blessing.
# NOTE the pattern excludes the CONTENTS, not the directory: git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent DIRECTORY is excluded, so `scripts/probe-out/` with a trailing slash would defeat the !rule.
scripts/probe-out/*
!scripts/probe-out/*.json

# --- frozen read-only exports (see _exports/README.md); never the source ---
_exports/

# --- screenshots dropped in the repo root while working ---
# Sam pastes these in to show a rendered card; they are never source. Root-anchored
# so nothing under static/ or docs/ is affected. Added 080126 after a `git add -A`
# swept eight of them into history.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.gif
/*.webp
/*.heic

# --- saved research pages dropped in the repo root ---
# Saved FamilySearch/Ancestry pages used as sources while enriching. Never source of
# truth -- whatever they contributed lives in canonical.json, and the page itself is
# re-fetchable. Root-anchored so src/app.html is untouched. Added 080726 after the
# same `git add -A` failure as above put a 236KB FamilySearch page into history
# alongside the Falkner children batch (068b3466).
/*.html
/Screenshot*
